{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"怡和大廈吊船意外　兩工人被困半空　其中一人獲救\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FALL-CENTRAL-261026-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】中環有吊船發生意外，兩名工人被困半空。</p><p>現場是中環怡和大廈，約下午六時許，兩名工人乘坐吊船進行高空工作期間，吊船懷疑發生故障，二人被困半空中。消防遊繩營救，其中一名工人獲救，送上救護車送院。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:40:58.917828+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:02:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:35.803096+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:15.841419+00:00","content_hash":"39e5ddc521b05618922ba6b2f31fbe104f098ad1e4cafdefb3651bae40df6656","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}